Armor HUD for Sunrise 26.3 (version 0.5.0)

A port of uku's Armor HUD (0.14.0, Minecraft 26.3 branch) by uku (uku3lig), based on
BerdinskiyBear's Armor HUD, with contributions from AnAwesomGuy and others.
Original source: https://github.com/uku3lig/armor-hud
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko: the widget, its settings and the break sound are implemented
in Rust on Sunrise's typed mod API (no Java code is included). This port is distributed
under the same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text is in LICENSE.

Assets carried from the original project under the MIT licence:
- icon.png
- assets/armorhud/textures/gui/sprites/warn.png (the warning icon)
- assets/armorhud/sounds/armor_breaking.ogg (the breaking sound)
- assets/armorhud/lang/en_us.json (the original's translations, namespaced `armorhud`, with
  added Options > Mods tooltips). The original ships no other languages.
